// AWS CloudWatch Alarms Deleted  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1562.001
// Detects deletion of CloudWatch alarms (DeleteAlarms), which can suppress alerting on malicious activity.
// False positives: Routine cleanup of unused alarms.
// Source: rules/defense-evasion/cloudwatch-delete-alarms.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName =~ "DeleteAlarms" and eventSource =~ "monitoring.amazonaws.com"
